OL,3,GNEWSAPolice Scotland could cut officer
OL,4,Anumbers to lowest level in 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland will have to cut
OL,7,Fofficer numbers to their lowest level
OL,8,Fin 23 years if it gets a "devastating"
OL,9,Fflat cash funding settlement, an
OL,10,Foversight body has warned.
OL,12,FThe Scottish Police Authority (SPA)
OL,13,Fsays recruitment would have to stop,
OL,14,Ftaking officer numbers down to 15,600 -
OL,15,Fthe lowest figure since 2003-04.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
