OL,3,GNEWSAPolice Scotland could cut officer
OL,4,Anumbers to lowest level in 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland is currently in line to
OL,7,Freceive a standstill budget allocation
OL,8,Ffor next year from the Scottish
OL,9,Fgovernment, but is asking for a #110m
OL,10,Fincrease to maintain current staffing
OL,11,Flevels and respond to an increasing
OL,12,Fworkload.
OL,14,FThe government said it delivered record
OL,15,Flevels of funding for policing this
OL,16,Fyear and is discussing next year's
OL,17,Fbudget with the force.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
